  "content": "\n\n<h1>真實之箭附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ftrue-shot-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/true-shot-enchantment-data-pack?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"License\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-ff5f5f?logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"Donate\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/paypal-donate-ff5f5f?logo=paypal&color=blue\" alt=\"Donate\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>📖 描述</h2>\n<p><code>真實之箭</code> 附魔讓箭矢忽略重力。</p>\n<p>此附魔可透過附魔台、戰利品寶箱或與村民交易獲得。</p>\n<p>當超過最大高度時，使用此附魔的箭矢會消失。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤/問題</h2>\n<p>請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題、錯誤或缺陷。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予物品：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot true_shot_enchantment:true_shot</code></pre>\n<p>附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s true_shot_enchantment:true_shot</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/true-shot-enchantment-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器代管</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器可能是一個非常耗時、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p>\n<p>但透過 BisectHosting，您只需點擊幾下就能擁有自己的伺服器！他們提供全天候支援與快速回應，絕不會讓任何問題阻礙您的遊玩體驗！有興趣嗎？我們為您準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<p><